  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When the time to withdraw into the depths comes, you are able to retreat with preternatural quickness.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Cecaelia subtype, character level 3rd.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You are able to swim 150 ft backward as a full-round action, as the jet universal monster ability. You must move in a straight line while jetting, but your movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/racial-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
